<title>USA: Gerber Scientific CEO undergoes surgery.</title>
<headline>Gerber Scientific CEO undergoes surgery.</headline>
<dateline>SOUTH WINDSOR, Conn 1997-04-22</dateline>
<text>
<p>The chairman and chief executive officer of Gerber Scientific Inc underwent successful heart bypass surgery, the company said Tuesday.</p>
<p>Gerber, which makes systems that automate industrial production, said George Gentile was expected to return to work after a brief recovery period.</p>
<p>Gentile underwent surgery on Monday, it added.</p>
